        "markdown": true,
        "text": "# Purrfect Uptime\n- Cat café meets server room\n- Seed round, Q1\n# The problem\n- Data centres are cold and lonely\n- Cats are warm and judgmental\n# The solution\n- Every rack gets a resident cat\n- Heat from the GPUs, purring in return\n- Downtime falls when someone is watching\n# Traction\n- 3 racks, 4 cats, 0 outages that the cats will admit to\n- One cat has root\n# The ask\n- $2M for kibble, cable guards and a very long laser pointer"
